<title>RUSSIA: UES H1 Russia pretax cash profit 851 bln rbls.</title>
<headline>UES H1 Russia pretax cash profit 851 bln rbls.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russia's national power company UES said on Monday unconsolidated pretax profit to Russian standards on a cash basis was 851 billion roubles in the first half of this year.</p>
<p>UES treasurer Alexander Lopatin said he did not have a comparative figure for the same period last year.</p>
